k my pasta?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No more than 10 minutes. I familiarized myself with many new recipes.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's good to hear. Tell me more.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, every week I love creating unique dishes for the first time. How's work going for you?", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": "engenn4le18ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, it's really challenging but satisfying too.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmmm, maybe you need to  ask what the manager expects.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: We must be productive every week and report to the manager every Friday. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds tough. I asked Daniel about his family life. Now I feel less pressure. You need to ask your boss some casual questions.", "id": 2, "time": "20000", "image": "engenn4le18ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, yeah? Like what?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: At lunchtime, you should ask him about his kids and his leisure activities. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah! Every morning I see him at the cafe. I'll try that.", "id": 3, "time": "44000", "image": "engenn4le18ob11re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}